  "balance_notes": [
    "Songhai is DPS-dense — most units fire 1.0-1.5/s. They die fast in melee but kill faster.",
    "Katara is the centerpiece. Place behind Demon Oni or Godpalm Tiger for protection.",
    "Flare Slinger's 192 range covers most maps from one corner. Pairs with a melee front.",
    "Kindling Blade relic punishes spaced single-target enemies — every 4th hit is essentially crit-tier damage.",
    "Ironbound Tide wave is the soft counter. Without anti-armor (Lyonar pierce, Vanar shatter), the pack stalls on the tanks.",
    "Speed-trait Swift on a Katara or Tiger is the strongest single trait in the pack."
  ]
